'''The Dust Plains''' are the southernmost area of [[Westfall]]. The plains have a population of [[gnoll]]s that threaten adventurers from their few camps. [[Klaven's Tower|An abandoned watch tower]], recently taken over by the Defias Brotherhood, is located on the eastern edge of the plains.

